{
    "title": "Traffic Jam: Hop On!",
    "description": "Welcome to Traffic Jam: Hop On!! \ud83e\udd29\r\n\r\n\u3010New levels! New elements! Turntables, obstacles, locked cars, bulldozers, and chain modes are waiting for you to challenge! Enjoy the pleasure of passing levels in the style of Bus Mania!\u3011\r\n\r\nPassengers are waiting for their own vehicles. Assign them to the appropriate vehicles according to their colors and then send them on the bus!\r\nDo you want to exercise your brain power? Do you want to improve your strategic thinking? When you successfully help all passengers find matching vehicles and solve complex problems, you will get an unprecedented sense of accomplishment and fun!\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n- \ud83d\ude97There are many vehicles of different colors and shapes in the parking lot. You need to successfully match the vehicles with the passengers according to your strategy. It is the best choice for you to exercise your brain\r\n- \ud83d\udcabSmooth control and animation, simple and easy to use\r\n- \ud83c\udfaeThere are many challenging and interesting levels. As the levels advance, there will be more and more new props and new elements, which is very fun\r\n- \ud83d\udeb6You can play offline anytime and anywhere, play at home, travel, and on the way to work\r\n- \ud83c\udf81Continuously pass levels to collect a variety of exquisite rare gifts\r\n- \ud83c\udf89Each level has a subtle design. When you keep unlocking new levels, you will find more and more surprises, and you will never be satisfied with staying at the current progress!\r\n\r\nCome and join us! You will enjoy our relaxing game, many new levels are constantly coming, and new challenges are still waiting for you!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Traffic Jam: Hop On!! \ud83e\udd29<br><br>\u3010New levels! New elements! Turntables, obstacles, locked cars, bulldozers, and chain modes are waiting for you to challenge! Enjoy the pleasure of passing levels in the style of Bus Mania!\u3011<br><br>Passengers are waiting for their own vehicles. Assign them to the appropriate vehicles according to their colors and then send them on the bus!<br>Do you want to exercise your brain power? Do you want to improve your strategic thinking? When you successfully help all passengers find matching vehicles and solve complex problems, you will get an unprecedented sense of accomplishment and fun!<br><br>Game features:<br>- \ud83d\ude97There are many vehicles of different colors and shapes in the parking lot. You need to successfully match the vehicles with the passengers according to your strategy. It is the best choice for you to exercise your brain<br>- \ud83d\udcabSmooth control and animation, simple and easy to use<br>- \ud83c\udfaeThere are many challenging and interesting levels. As the levels advance, there will be more and more new props and new elements, which is very fun<br>- \ud83d\udeb6You can play offline anytime and anywhere, play at home, travel, and on the way to work<br>- \ud83c\udf81Continuously pass levels to collect a variety of exquisite rare gifts<br>- \ud83c\udf89Each level has a subtle design. When you keep unlocking new levels, you will find more and more surprises, and you will never be satisfied with staying at the current progress!<br><br>Come and join us! You will enjoy our relaxing game, many new levels are constantly coming, and new challenges are still waiting for you!",
